{"unit_id":"TNJ2026__promptaflow#card-card-zh","repo":"TNJ2026/promptaflow","commit":"55d6cf134e10f99be4ad1a9ad7926ab9ee6e7616","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"PromptaFlow 是面向 DeepSeek Harness 网页端的本地 Agent 工作流插件。它通过 MCP 网关连接按 Workspace 隔离的 Runtime，并在会话中注册工作流与运行管理工具，也提供运行面板和 Artifact 查看入口。用户可以从描述生成工作流、启动并检查运行、处理暂停步骤、查看产物，也能把 Agent 步骤委托给当前对话执行。适合需要把多步 Agent 任务保存、追踪和恢复的 Harness 用户；需另行安装并运行本地 PromptaFlow Runtime。","source":"generated","evidence":["integrations/deepseek-harness/src/index.ts:92-109","integrations/deepseek-harness/src/promptaflow-tools.ts:40-55","integration-core/src/gateway.ts:40-46"]}
