{"unit_id":"TNJ2026__promptaflow#feature-workflow-tools","repo":"TNJ2026/promptaflow","commit":"55d6cf134e10f99be4ad1a9ad7926ab9ee6e7616","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"PromptaFlow 的功能「工作流管理」：通过会话工具列出当前 Workspace 已发布的工作流，并可按条件筛选是否只显示可运行项。 通过 DeepSeek Harness 会话工具触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["integrations/deepseek-harness/src/promptaflow-tools.ts:46-47"]}
{"unit_id":"TNJ2026__promptaflow#feature-authoring","repo":"TNJ2026/promptaflow","commit":"55d6cf134e10f99be4ad1a9ad7926ab9ee6e7616","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"PromptaFlow 的功能「生成工作流」：用户描述目标后，生成工具异步提交工作流草稿；可以查询编写任务状态，面板也会显示进度。 通过 DeepSeek Harness 会话工具触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["integrations/deepseek-harness/src/promptaflow-tools.ts:125-153"]}
{"unit_id":"TNJ2026__promptaflow#feature-run-control","repo":"TNJ2026/promptaflow","commit":"55d6cf134e10f99be4ad1a9ad7926ab9ee6e7616","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"PromptaFlow 的功能「运行控制」：可启动工作流、检查运行状态，并根据 Runtime 当前公布的命令取消或恢复运行。 通过 DeepSeek Harness 会话工具触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["integrations/deepseek-harness/src/promptaflow-tools.ts:108-120"]}
{"unit_id":"TNJ2026__promptaflow#feature-delegation","repo":"TNJ2026/promptaflow","commit":"55d6cf134e10f99be4ad1a9ad7926ab9ee6e7616","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"PromptaFlow 的功能「当前对话委托」：会话工具可领取排队的 Agent 步骤、续租并提交结果，使 Harness 当前对话能接手工作流步骤。 通过 DeepSeek Harness 会话工具触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["integrations/deepseek-harness/src/promptaflow-tools.ts:57-97"]}
